       "reasons": [
        {
         "@type": "meaningComprehension",
         "comprehends": [
          "copies/yg667ds7662.jsonld#inscription-text"
         ],
         "note": "Stamped, not written, in a plain sans-serif numeral type; here the UPPER panel is the upright one. The four figures are perfectly clear, the 2 filled in with ink, and two faint marks stand a little to the right of the 5, perhaps the remains of a further stamped character. Read as the usual run without separators, 7 1 25 gives 7 January 1925, which fits the corpus. What I cannot show from the image is that the group is a date at all rather than a roll or serial number, and there is no hand or separator to corroborate it, so the confidence is low for that reason and not because of any figure. Region 2 carries no writing."
        }
       ]
      }
     }
    },
